  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "665ac8f4-724e-4a1b-91ef-57e26a97c4bc",
    "name": "ACMS - Part F Contributions and payments",
    "description": "Run in order with the ACMS-Local environment. Needs a Finance Officer account (financeUsername, and financePassword in the environment), the registrar and farmer accounts, ownFarmerId = the farmer linked to farmerUsername, and officerUserId/ownDistrictId as in Part E. Each run creates its own season, so it can be run again.",
